00:25.830 --> 00:28.970
<i>I'll be living with Mukai-kun and 
the others during summer break.</i>

00:26.830 --> 00:34.430
<b>Fireworks Festival
August 24th</b>

00:29.490 --> 00:33.060
<i>I need to do everything I can to
