19:21.440 --> 19:23.050
Thank you!

19:27.460 --> 19:28.640
It's good.

19:30.020 --> 19:31.930
You did it, Minase-san!

19:34.410 --> 19:36.690
That meat looks expensive.

19:37.520 --> 19:39.420
Naoya-kun paid for the ingredients.

19:39.420 --> 19:41.450
I burned through all the money I earned.

19:41.450 --> 19:42.910
Stop endangering yourself!

19:42.910 --> 19:44.340
Have some of this, too.

19:46.360 --> 19:47.540
It's good.

19:47.790 --> 19:49.380
There's more.

19:51.140 --> 19:52.750
It's all good.

19:53.940 --> 19:59.240
You must have worked really hard
 to become such a good cook.

19:59.240 --> 20:00.590
Wow.

20:00.590 --> 20:05.080
You're honest when you praise me, 
even though you hate me.

20:05.080 --> 20:05.840
I love you.

20:05.840 --> 20:06.600
I know.

20:06.600 --> 20:07.500
So charming.

20:07.500 --> 20:09.810
That's exactly what I hate about you!

20:09.810 --> 20:12.270
Besides, it does taste good, but...

20:12.270 --> 20:13.350
Meat!

20:13.350 --> 20:14.320
Oil!

20:14.320 --> 20:15.730
Carbs!

20:15.730 --> 20:18.190
There's no nutritional balance!

20:21.570 --> 20:25.040
You need to get your veggies in, 
or you're going to get sick.

20:25.040 --> 20:26.030
I see!

20:26.430 --> 20:28.840
You're hopeless.

20:28.840 --> 20:30.250
Thank you!

20:31.330 --> 20:33.200
You're so kind, Shino-san.

20:33.200 --> 20:36.040
Naoya-kun will appreciate me even more now.

20:37.960 --> 20:39.750
Sh-Shit!

20:40.110 --> 20:44.130
Nagisa-chan committed herself 
to cooking to impress Naoya.

20:45.940 --> 20:47.480
For Mukai-kun?

20:50.720 --> 20:52.310
Tell me something...

20:53.180 --> 20:58.650
Did you fall in love with Mukai-kun 
not knowing he was already with Sakisaki?

21:00.160 --> 21:01.530
I knew.

21:02.610 --> 21:04.330
Unbelievable!

21:04.820 --> 21:08.780
Do you have any idea how much hell 
you're putting Sakisaki through?

21:09.270 --> 21:09.990
Minase-san!

21:10.630 --> 21:13.880
I don't think I really know.

21:15.050 --> 21:19.800
I don't think I can even fathom 
how much I've put Saki-san through

21:19.800 --> 21:24.670
and how much I will in the future
in order to keep this relationship.

21:26.130 --> 21:28.990
I feel very guilty about it.

21:28.990 --> 21:30.830
So stop the two-timing relationship now!

21:30.830 --> 21:33.560
But I love Naoya-kun.

21:35.270 --> 21:40.520
He said he'd never let me go, 
and I've decided to stay with him.

21:42.350 --> 21:44.940
I want to be friends with you,

21:44.940 --> 21:48.410
but I don't have any intention of 
breaking up with Naoya-kun!

21:49.160 --> 21:50.620
Minase-san...

21:50.620 --> 21:52.090
Nagisa-chan...

21:52.580 --> 21:55.460
Th-That's just how it is for me.

21:56.670 --> 22:00.840
You look so frail, but you're so 
obnoxiously assertive when it matters.

22:03.140 --> 22:05.630
Hey, let's try to get along.

22:05.980 --> 22:06.590
No!

22:06.590 --> 22:07.970
I'm sorry!

22:07.970 --> 22:11.810
I hate Minase-san even more now.

22:12.930 --> 22:15.480
I'm absolutely going to make 
you end your relationship!

22:16.130 --> 22:17.560
I'm not backing down!

22:17.560 --> 22:19.000
Let's do this!

22:19.000 --> 22:19.900
Yes!

22:23.540 --> 22:26.720
I'm putting an end to this, I swear!

22:26.720 --> 22:29.070
Shino's scary...

22:29.530 --> 22:37.000
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

22:29.900 --> 22:32.440
Gross... Gotta make it again.

22:32.440 --> 22:37.000
Uh... I can't keep eating 
your botched cooking.

22:37.000 --> 22:42.000
<b>Welcome, Shino-san</b>

24:12.330 --> 24:14.670
Next episode preview, but it's on Risapon TV!

24:14.670 --> 24:16.720
Everyone's headed to the fireworks festival!

24:16.720 --> 24:19.640
I'm gonna seduce Naoya in my yukata!

24:19.640 --> 24:21.520
That's what she says, but don't mind her.

24:21.520 --> 24:23.020
Am I getting rejected again?!

24:23.020 --> 24:24.320
See you next time!

24:24.320 --> 24:26.980
Tell me! Please!
